title: Both changes of a CRLF file staged one by one, then the appended line unstaged: index must hold only 'SECOND line\r', no line ending changed anywhere
folders: odd-files
expect-file: odd-files/crlf.txt :: ^first line\r\nSECOND line\r\nthird line\r\nfourth line\r\n$
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 4000
left changes
goto crlf.txt
wait 1200
part stage crlf.txt 4
wait 1500
part stage crlf.txt 2
wait 1500
part unstage crlf.txt 4
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
